{
  "id": "dialogue.mano.growth",
  "kind": "dialogue",
  "title": "成長の証",
  "status": "review",
  "version": 1,
  "rootId": "draft.dialogue.mano.growth",
  "payload": {
    "id": "dialogue.mano.growth",
    "idolId": "mano",
    "startNodeId": "01",
    "nodes": {
      "10": {
        "id": "10",
        "speakerId": "mano",
        "text": "那、那倒是……但是……",
        "nextNodeId": "11"
      },
      "11": {
        "id": "11",
        "speakerId": "mano",
        "text": "别人说我可爱，和制作人说我可爱，是不一样的。",
        "nextNodeId": "12"
      },
      "12": {
        "id": "12",
        "speakerId": "mano",
        "text": "因为制作人一直都说\"拍得挺好\"这种话……",
        "nextNodeId": "13"
      },
      "13": {
        "id": "13",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "这样啊。那以后我多说几次可爱？",
        "nextNodeId": "14"
      },
      "14": {
        "id": "14",
        "speakerId": "mano",
        "text": "呼哇哇，不用、不用天天都说也可以的！",
        "nextNodeId": "15"
      },
      "15": {
        "id": "15",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "是吗？不过可爱就是可爱啊。",
        "nextNodeId": "16"
      },
      "16": {
        "id": "16",
        "speakerId": "mano",
        "text": "呼哇哇……",
        "nextNodeId": "17"
      },
      "17": {
        "id": "17",
        "speakerId": "mano",
        "text": "那个……那，您觉得哪张拍得好？",
        "choices": [
          {
            "label": "温柔微笑着的那张",
            "nextNodeId": "2-01",
            "effects": [
              {
                "kind": "attributeExp",
                "ref": "expression",
                "tier": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "label": "眨眼的那张",
            "nextNodeId": "3-01",
            "effects": [
              {
                "kind": "attributeExp",
                "ref": "trust",
                "tier": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "label": "呼呼的那张",
            "nextNodeId": "4-01",
            "effects": [
              {
                "kind": "sharedStat",
                "stat": "stress",
                "delta": -2
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "01": {
        "id": "01",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "咦？真乃还在啊，已经很晚了哦？",
        "nextNodeId": "02"
      },
      "02": {
        "id": "02",
        "speakerId": "mano",
        "text": "啊，制作人……呼哇……已经这个时间了。",
        "nextNodeId": "03"
      },
      "03": {
        "id": "03",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "你在看照片？那是……之前拍的宣传照吧。",
        "nextNodeId": "04"
      },
      "04": {
        "id": "04",
        "speakerId": "mano",
        "text": "是的。拍完给我看过一次，但还想再看一次。",
        "nextNodeId": "05"
      },
      "05": {
        "id": "05",
        "speakerId": "mano",
        "text": "和很久以前拍的照片比，我觉得这张的笑容更自然。",
        "nextNodeId": "06"
      },
      "06": {
        "id": "06",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "嗯，拍得很可爱。",
        "nextNodeId": "07"
      },
      "07": {
        "id": "07",
        "speakerId": "mano",
        "text": "呼哇！可、可爱……",
        "nextNodeId": "08"
      },
      "08": {
        "id": "08",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "嗯？这么惊讶？",
        "nextNodeId": "09"
      },
      "09": {
        "id": "09",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "平时摄影师和粉丝不都说你可爱吗？",
        "nextNodeId": "10"
      },
      "2-01": {
        "id": "2-01",
        "speakerId": "mano",
        "text": "这张……不太像偶像的笑法吧……？其他偶像的笑容，感觉更耀眼。",
        "nextNodeId": "2-02"
      },
      "2-02": {
        "id": "2-02",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "是吗？我倒觉得这张最像真乃。",
        "nextNodeId": "2-03"
      },
      "2-03": {
        "id": "2-03",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "看照片的人会被带着露出笑容——这张有那种力量。",
        "nextNodeId": "2-04"
      },
      "2-04": {
        "id": "2-04",
        "speakerId": "mano",
        "text": "呼哇……如果真的能那样，我会非常高兴。谢谢您，制作人。",
        "nextNodeId": "2-05"
      },
      "2-05": {
        "id": "2-05",
        "speakerId": "mano",
        "text": "……那个，这张照片，我可以带走吗？",
        "nextNodeId": "2-06"
      },
      "2-06": {
        "id": "2-06",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "可以啊，数据还留着。",
        "nextNodeId": "2-07"
      },
      "2-07": {
        "id": "2-07",
        "speakerId": "mano",
        "text": "不是，我是想……如果可以的话，送给制作人。",
        "nextNodeId": "2-08"
      },
      "2-08": {
        "id": "2-08",
        "speakerId": "mano",
        "text": "制作人一直很努力，看起来很辛苦……",
        "nextNodeId": "2-09"
      },
      "2-09": {
        "id": "2-09",
        "speakerId": "mano",
        "text": "我想，至少能让您笑一下就好了。",
        "nextNodeId": "2-10"
      },
      "2-10": {
        "id": "2-10",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "这样啊。我是一直从真乃这里得到精神的那个……",
        "nextNodeId": "2-11"
      },
      "2-11": {
        "id": "2-11",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "不过，嗯，我收下了。谢谢。",
        "nextNodeId": "2-12"
      },
      "2-12": {
        "id": "2-12",
        "speakerId": "mano",
        "text": "好！今后我也会为了拍出好笑容努力的！"
      },
      "3-01": {
        "id": "3-01",
        "speakerId": "mano",
        "text": "这、这张吗！？",
        "nextNodeId": "3-02"
      },
      "3-02": {
        "id": "3-02",
        "speakerId": "mano",
        "text": "这张是……摄影师让我大胆试试看才拍的……",
        "nextNodeId": "3-03"
      },
      "3-03": {
        "id": "3-03",
        "speakerId": "mano",
        "text": "就、就跟不是我似的……好害羞……",
        "nextNodeId": "3-04"
      },
      "3-04": {
        "id": "3-04",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "没有那种事。这也是真乃。",
        "nextNodeId": "3-05"
      },
      "3-05": {
        "id": "3-05",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "新的真乃的魅力，表现得很清楚。",
        "nextNodeId": "3-06"
      },
      "3-06": {
        "id": "3-06",
        "speakerId": "mano",
        "text": "真、真的吗……？",
        "nextNodeId": "3-07"
      },
      "3-07": {
        "id": "3-07",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "你再看一次，觉得怎么样？",
        "nextNodeId": "3-08"
      },
      "3-08": {
        "id": "3-08",
        "speakerId": "mano",
        "text": "一开始，我觉得根本不像我。",
        "nextNodeId": "3-09"
      },
      "3-09": {
        "id": "3-09",
        "speakerId": "mano",
        "text": "但听制作人这么说之后，我觉得……原来我也能做这样的表情了。",
        "nextNodeId": "3-10"
      },
      "3-10": {
        "id": "3-10",
        "speakerId": "mano",
        "text": "这张照片，可以给我吗？制作人今天说的话，我不想忘记。",
        "nextNodeId": "3-11"
      },
      "3-11": {
        "id": "3-11",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "嗯。数据有，拿去就好。",
        "nextNodeId": "3-12"
      },
      "3-12": {
        "id": "3-12",
        "speakerId": "mano",
        "text": "谢谢。为了能展现更多新的我，我会努力的。"
      },
      "4-01": {
        "id": "4-01",
        "speakerId": "mano",
        "text": "这张……我自己觉得拍得不太好，总觉得没什么力气……",
        "nextNodeId": "4-02"
      },
      "4-02": {
        "id": "4-02",
        "speakerId": "mano",
        "text": "感觉从最初到现在，好像没有成长。",
        "nextNodeId": "4-03"
      },
      "4-03": {
        "id": "4-03",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "是吗？好，你等一下。",
        "nextNodeId": "4-04"
      },
      "4-04": {
        "id": "4-04",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "我把最初拍的照片拿来了。和刚才那张摆在一起看。",
        "nextNodeId": "4-05"
      },
      "4-05": {
        "id": "4-05",
        "speakerId": "mano",
        "text": "果然和以前比，好像没什么不同……",
        "nextNodeId": "4-06"
      },
      "4-06": {
        "id": "4-06",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "再仔细看看？表情是相似，但这张更有光。",
        "nextNodeId": "4-07"
      },
      "4-07": {
        "id": "4-07",
        "speakerId": "mano",
        "text": "被这么说，好像也有点……？我，真的成长了吗？",
        "nextNodeId": "4-08"
      },
      "4-08": {
        "id": "4-08",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "这两张都像真乃。不过，现在的真乃——",
        "nextNodeId": "4-09"
      },
      "4-09": {
        "id": "4-09",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "作为偶像，更有魅力了。",
        "nextNodeId": "4-10"
      },
      "4-10": {
        "id": "4-10",
        "speakerId": "mano",
        "text": "呼哇……被制作人这样说……我很高兴。",
        "nextNodeId": "4-11"
      },
      "4-11": {
        "id": "4-11",
        "speakerId": "mano",
        "text": "我作为偶像……想要更多地改变自己……"
      }
    }
  },
